Description: Ptyxis with hostname tab colors and clipboard shortcuts
 Unofficial Ptyxis fork providing automatic hostname colors, persistent
 manual tab colors, and right-click copy/paste. Uses a separate application
 ID and settings namespace alongside the distribution's regular Ptyxis.
